ONAL BASKETBALL CHAMPIONSHIP SERIES AND HIDING UP TO ONE MILLION DOLLARS (OR EVEN MORE) OF FREE BURRITOS IN ITS TV ADS."}{'symbol': 'CTAS', 'date': '2021-07-08 10:00:00-04:56', 'title': "Cintas Corporation Ranked No. 6 on Selling Power's “50 Best Companies to Sell For” List in 2021", 'text': 'CINCINNATI--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $CTAS--CINTAS RANKS NO. 6 ON SELLING POWER\'S "50 BEST COMPANIES TO SELL FOR" LIST IN 2021, CONTINUING ITS STEADY RISE UP THE PUBLICATION\'S ANNUAL RANKINGS.'}{'symbol': 'CCI', 'date': '2021-07-08 16:15:00-04:56', 'title': 'Crown Castle Announces Second Quarter 2021 Earnings Conference Call Details', 'text': 'HOUSTON, JULY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CROWN CASTLE INTERNATIONAL CORP. (NYSE: CCI) ("CROWN CASTLE") PLANS TO RELEASE ITS SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS ON WEDNESDAY, JULY 21, 2021, AFTER THE MARKET CLOSES. IN CONJUNCTION WITH THE RELEASE, CROWN CASTLE HAS SCHEDULED A CONFERENCE CALL FOR THURSDAY, JULY 22, 2021, AT 10:30 A.M. EASTERN TIME. THE CONFERENCE CALL MAY BE ACCESSED BY DIALING 888-394-8218 AND ASKING FOR THE CROWN CASTLE CALL (ACCESS CODE 1720768) AT LEAST 30 MINUTES PRIOR TO THE START TIME. THE CONFERENCE CALL MAY ALSO BE ACCESSED LIVE OVER THE INTERNET AT HTTP://INVESTOR.CROWNCASTLE.COM. ANY SUPPLEMENTAL MATERIALS FOR THE CALL WILL BE POSTED ON THE CROWN CASTLE WEBSITE AT HTTP://INVESTOR.CROWNCASTLE.COM.'}{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2021-07-08 14:46:00-04:56', 'title': 'CSX Releases 2020 Environmental, Social and Governance Report', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA., JULY 08, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) TODAY RELEASED ITS 2020 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT, HIGHLIGHTING THE COMPANY'S SUSTAINABILITY PERFORMANCE IN THE AREAS OF SAFETY, PEOPLE AND COMMUNITIES, ENVIRONMENT, AND GOVERNANCE."}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-07-08 16:15:00-04:56', 'title': '3rd Eye Launches New Eye-Site Next-Generation Data Interface', 'text': 'DOWNER GROVE, ILL., JULY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3RD EYE,\xa0PART OF\xa0ENV